     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "We have launched a surprise offensive against the Syrian Arab Army and captured swathes of the country including Aleppo."\
     ""\
     "We now want to continue our offensive south towards Hama. Ahead of us, a SAA checkpoint blocks the main road, set up in a roadside abandoned construction site. This checkpoint includes an AGS-30 grenade launcher and KORD HMG."\
     ""\
     "Our unit has been tasked with taking over this checkpoint."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "HTS"
     }
