     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "Hayat Tahrir al-Sham has launched a surprise offensive against the Syrian Arab Army and captured swathes of the country including Aleppo."\
     ""\
     "Their offensive now continues south towards Hama. Our unit has been tasked with manning a checkpoint set up in an abandoned roadside construction site to cover retreating SAA units and prevent HTS from advancing further south."\
     ""\
     "A motorized HTS element has been observed forming up north of us, and we believe an attack is imminent."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "SAA"
